        "41bfc9112480c3d83331ed93470c7f675a9d5b1a"
      ],
      "title": "macos-setup.sh: don't build libxml2 with Python.",
      "message": "macos-setup.sh: don't build libxml2 with Python.\n\nAt least on Monterey, with Xcode 13.1, the linker whines that we weren't\ngranted the Sacred and Holy Right to link with the Python 2.7 framework.\nAs far as I know, we have no need to use that framework, so configure it\nout.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "authored_date": "2021-12-13T14:22:06.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "Guy Harris",
